sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User / CI
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant Webhook as spark-operator webhook<br/>9443/TCP TLS
    participant Controller as spark-operator controller<br/>8080/TCP metrics
    participant Kubelet as Kubelet<br/>10250/TCP HTTPS
    participant Driver as Spark Driver Pod
    participant Executor as Spark Executor Pods
    participant ConnectPod as SparkConnect Pod<br/>15002/TCP gRPC

    Note over User, Executor: Flow 1: SparkApplication Submission
    User->>K8sAPI: POST SparkApplication CR<br/>Bearer token / kubeconfig
    K8sAPI->>Webhook: Admission review<br/>HTTPS/443→9443<br/>TLS (self-provisioned)
    Webhook->>Webhook: Validate spec + resource quotas<br/>Mutate defaults
    Webhook-->>K8sAPI: Admission response (allow/deny)
    K8sAPI-->>User: CR created/rejected

    Note over Controller, Executor: Controller Reconciliation
    K8sAPI->>Controller: Watch event (SparkApplication)<br/>ServiceAccount token
    Controller->>K8sAPI: Create Driver Pod<br/>ServiceAccount token
    K8sAPI->>Kubelet: Schedule Driver Pod<br/>TLS / Node token
    Kubelet-->>Driver: Start Driver
    Driver->>K8sAPI: Request Executor Pods<br/>ServiceAccount token
    K8sAPI->>Kubelet: Schedule Executor Pods
    Kubelet-->>Executor: Start Executors
    Executor-->>Driver: Register (driver-rpc 7078)
    Driver-->>Executor: Task assignments (blockmanager 7079)
    Controller->>K8sAPI: Create Spark UI Service (4040/TCP)

    Note over User, ConnectPod: Flow 2: SparkConnect gRPC Session
    User->>K8sAPI: POST SparkConnect CR<br/>Bearer token
    K8sAPI->>Webhook: Admission review
    Webhook-->>K8sAPI: Validated
    K8sAPI->>Controller: Watch event (SparkConnect)
    Controller->>K8sAPI: Create SparkConnect Pod
    User->>ConnectPod: gRPC connection<br/>15002/TCP
    ConnectPod->>K8sAPI: Manage Spark executors<br/>ServiceAccount token

    Note over User, ConnectPod: Flow 3: ScheduledSparkApplication
    User->>K8sAPI: POST ScheduledSparkApplication CR
    K8sAPI->>Webhook: Admission review
    Webhook-->>K8sAPI: Validated
    Controller->>Controller: Cron schedule evaluation<br/>(robfig/cron)
    Controller->>K8sAPI: Create SparkApplication on schedule
